# Icon art, regenerated by:
#   cargo run --features serve --example gen_icons
#
# Not committed: it is ~7 MB, because the encoder in src/icon.rs writes stored
# (uncompressed) deflate so the crate needs no compression dependency. That is a
# fine trade for a build artifact and a bad one for git history, so the release
# workflow regenerates it and the geometry in src/desktop.rs stays the source of
# truth for the mark.
windows/lakeleto.ico
macos/Lakeleto.iconset/
macos/Lakeleto.icns

# Built installers.
windows/*.msi
windows/*.wixpdb
macos/*.dmg
macos/Lakeleto.app/
